libplacebo: tone (and gamut) mapping rework from upstream MR !875

Source: https://code.videolan.org/videolan/libplacebo/-/merge_requests/875
        (kasper93, branch fix-tone-mapping, head 4bde369b, MR base 41ac2980),
        regenerated as one diff against libplacebo master 3330a515 so it
        applies with plain `git apply` after 9001.
Why:    the HDR -> SDR tone mapping fix requested in mgth/mpv-omniphony#72
        (upstream discussion: mpv-player/mpv#15340). Not released yet; the
        FEL build already tracks libplacebo master, so carry it here until
        the MR lands upstream, then drop this file.
Adds:   pl_color_map_params.film_strength (API 372, default 0.3, [0,2]) and
        .mastering_clip (API 373, default 1.0, [0,1]), reachable from mpv as
        --libplacebo-opts=film_strength=...,mastering_clip=... (no mpv change).
        Bumps the soname (libplacebo.so.373): relink mpv after rebuilding.

